{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "7d2128f5-256f-86ef-9711-a9b1e8ce053f",
  "created_at": "2025-12-09T14:21:40-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Public Works",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Adriana Quintero",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Denise Arruda",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-09T14:19:40-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Public Works, this is Denise."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-09T14:19:43-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hello? Oh, sorry, I thought you were saying something. Hang on. [pause] Sorry, that was my television. I'm still here."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-09T14:19:51-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No problem at all. What can I help you with?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-09T14:19:55-05:00",
      "duration": 15,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sorry, I know this is probably small. I'm calling about the catch basin at the corner by my place. It's packed with leaves, and since the nor'easter from Friday into Saturday the water just sits there and backs up into my driveway."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-09T14:20:10-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. What's the address?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-09T14:20:12-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "268 Bellevue Avenue, in the Bellevue area. The drain's right at the corner there."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-09T14:20:18-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Got it, 268 Bellevue. Is the water still standing today, or only when it rains?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-09T14:20:24-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sorry, it's still there today, even though it's been three days. It's running down the edge of the driveway toward my neighbor's garage. It hasn't gotten inside that I can see, but it's heading that way."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-09T14:20:37-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "All right. So the grate is covered with leaves and the water has nowhere to go."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-09T14:20:44-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, that's it. I'd clear it myself, but I know I shouldn't be fooling with a city drain. Sorry."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-09T14:20:52-05:00",
      "duration": 15,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You're right to leave it. Stay out of the street with it. I'll put in a work order for a crew to clear that basin and mark it as water heading toward a garage, so it gets looked at sooner."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-09T14:21:07-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Thank you. Sorry to bother you with it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-09T14:21:11-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It's no bother, that's what we're here for. Do you want a call when it's done?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-09T14:21:17-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, please, if you could call me back once it's cleared. Sorry, the number is 401-555-0162."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-09T14:21:23-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "401-555-0162. Got it. And your name?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-09T14:21:26-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Adriana Quintero."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-09T14:21:28-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, Ms. Quintero, the order is in. Someone will call you when the crew has been out."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-09T14:21:35-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Thank you very much. Goodbye."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-09T14:21:38-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Bye now."
    }
  ],
